# Input

```vue
<template>
  <p><span>label</span>{{ label }}{{ description }}{{ hint }}</p>
  <p><span>label</span><img src="image.png" />{{ description }}</p>
</template>

```


# Options

```json
{
	"formatter": {
		"lineWidth": 40
	}
}
```

# Formatted

```vue
<template>
	<p>
		<span>label</span>{{ label }}{{
			description
		}}{{ hint }}
	</p>
	<p>
		<span>label</span><img
			src="image.png"
		>{{ description }}
	</p>
</template>

```
